@startuml
actor 组织者 as Organizer
participant 前端 as Frontend
participant ActivityResultController as Controller
participant ActivityService as ActivitySvc
participant ActivityResultService as ResultSvc
participant 文件系统 as FileSystem
database SQLite as DB

Organizer -> Frontend: 选择图片上传
Frontend -> Controller: POST /results/upload-images/{activityId}
Controller -> ActivitySvc: getById(activityId)
ActivitySvc -> DB: 查询活动
DB --> ActivitySvc: 活动数据
ActivitySvc --> Controller: Activity

Controller -> Controller: 校验文件类型/大小

alt 校验通过
    loop 每张图片
      Controller -> Controller: 生成UUID文件名
      Controller -> ResultSvc: saveImage(file, filename, activityId)
      ResultSvc -> FileSystem: 写入文件
      FileSystem --> ResultSvc: 文件路径
      ResultSvc --> Controller: URL路径
    end
    Controller --> Frontend: URL列表
    Frontend --> Organizer: 显示上传成功
else 校验失败
    Controller --> Frontend: 错误信息
    Frontend --> Organizer: 提示错误
end
@enduml